**Windows methods (`windowsMethods`):**

| Method id | Notes (from install docs — follow `installUrl` for exact commands) |
|-----------|---------------------------------------------------------------------|
| `fixed-path-sdk` | **Sole** Windows method. Download the official Windows zip/installer assets per `installUrl`. Place the SDK so **`gcloud.cmd`** is exactly at **`windowsInstallPath`**. Ensure that `bin` directory is on PATH when dry-runs use bare **`cli`**. **Forbidden:** winget/chocolatey substitutes; open-ended install-directory questions. |

**dryRuns:**

| # | `command` | `expect` |
|---|-----------|----------|
| 1 | `gcloud version` | Exit **0**; stdout includes a Google Cloud SDK / gcloud version ≥ **`minVersion`** |
| 2 | `gcloud help` | Exit **0** |

Prefer running **`dryRuns`** with the resolved **`macosInstallPath`** /
**`linuxInstallPath`** / **`windowsInstallPath`** as the executable (substitute
the path for the leading **`cli`** token). Bare **`cli`** is allowed only when
invoking via PATH after a confirmed PATH hit.

## Agent obligations

1. Treat this inventory as the **only** required-tools source for this center.
2. Probe in order: (a) resolved **`macosInstallPath`** / **`linuxInstallPath`** /
   **`windowsInstallPath`** for the current OS; (b) any **user-supplied path/command**
   from the install mission gate; (c) `command -v` / PATH on **`cli`**. Do not
   invent alternate install directories.
3. Compare discovered version to **`minVersion`** — classify **ok**, **outdated**,
   or **missing**.
4. Install only after structured-choice consent to **install** (not method/path
   choice). Use the **sole** listed OS method id; place the binary exactly at
   the OS install path; follow method notes and **`installUrl`**. **Forbidden:**
   method pickers; install-directory questions.
5. After install (or path override), run **every** **`dryRuns`** row in order
   (prefer install-path executable) and record pass/fail.
6. For Drive **`lsf`** / **bisync**, apply **Drive auth invoke** — SA flags and
   probe order — before suggesting **`rclone config reconnect`**.

